Package: infillgls
Title: Generalized Least Squares Building Blocks for Infill Research
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Christopher",
           family = "Engh",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generalized least squares routines for spatial data with a fixed
    user-supplied working covariance. The main formula interface accepts
    spatial locations, a covariance kernel, and a declared target treatment
    coefficient. It returns GLS estimates, residual-scale standard errors,
    normal confidence intervals, and p-values.
